{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti in nanul 1884, la Shinagawa, \u00een golfutociu. O nav\u0103 \u0219coal\u0103 pe nume\u021bucuba se preg\u0103te\u0219te de plecare. \u0218tiai c\u0103 \u00eentr-o c\u0103l\u0103torie ca asta, cu un an \u00eenainte, aproape jum\u0103tate din echipaj, s-am bolnavit din cauza aceea ce m\u00e2nc\u0103, pe nav\u0103riu jo, o 160 \u0219i 9 de oamenii au f\u0103cut b\u0103riberii, 20 \u0219i 5 au murit. Uite farfuria unui marinar. Orez alb, o rezul era gratuit, tot restul costa b\u0103ni. Un medical marinei, t\u0103cachii, canehiro, m\u0103soar\u0103 ce m\u00e2n\u00e2nc\u0103 oamenii \u0219i schimb\u0103 meniu, mai mult orz carne, lapte, p\u00e2ine \u0219i legume. Pe\u021bucuba se \u00eenbolnavesc pai\u021bi prezece oamenii. Num\u0103r\u0103 niciunul, iar cei pai\u021bi prezece, num\u0103 \u00een casera din nou a hran\u0103. Deci, cei e m\u00e2ncare acum, ceva de m\u0103surat? Conteaz\u0103 cei \u00een\u0103untru. Primele tabele de mortalitate ale japoniei, \u00eei dau unui nou n\u0103scut vreo, 40 \u0219i 3 de ani. \u0218i b\u0103rba\u021bi \u0219i japonez n\u0103scu\u021biatunci cu aproximativ 15 cm mai scuns de c\u00e2t cei n\u0103scu\u021bi un secol mai t\u00e2rziu. Peste c\u00e2teva de cei nii prime\u0219te un nume. O vitamina, dar s\u0103 \u0219tice l-i pse\u0219te, nu apunem farfuria unui familiei s\u0103race.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.54, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti in nanul 1884, la Shinagawa, \u00een golfutociu.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 294, 14067, 425, 2443, 25494, 11, 635, 17347, 559, 10449, 11, 15351, 9988, 69, 325, 905, 5951, 13, 50658], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.47574145977313703, "compression_ratio": 1.3837209302325582, "no_speech_prob": 0.05921955406665802, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "probability": 0.2860155701637268}, {"word": " treze\u0219ti", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.7737376466393471}, {"word": " in", "start": 